## The weekly townhall (release 35)

Every Wednesday at 1:00 pm Toronto time, and everyone attends. Open **Townhall**: **Join the call** there, or **Check in** from 15 minutes before, counts you as there. You get a reminder an hour before.',
  '<h3 class="gd-h3">Who this guide is for</h3><p class="gd-p">CarmaCars field staff: drivers, detailers, and drivers who also detail. You hand cars over, take them back, move them and shoot listing photos. Everything is on your phone. Your jobs are under <b class="gd-ui">Field work</b> in the staff portal; if you also hold another function (Sales, for example), its pages are in the same menu.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">What you need</h3><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Your phone, charged, with a data connection (photos and signatures save as you take them)</li><li>The invitation email from CarmaCars (the link works for 24 hours)</li><li>A car charger and a cloth for the camera lens</li></ul><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-your-first-sign-in" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your first sign-in</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the invitation email on your phone and press its link within 24 hours. Choose a password and press <b class="gd-ui">Save the new password</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">You land on <b class="gd-ui">Today</b>. Next time, sign in at <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/sign-in</span> with your Email and Password.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">In your browser&#39;s menu, choose <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>. The portal then opens full screen, like an app.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, add your mobile number and press <b class="gd-ui">Save my phone</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">At the top of the page, fill in your Home address and Postal code and press <b class="gd-ui">Save my home address</b>. You need it before you add a rental or earn a commission.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/920"><img src="/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-f05000e2.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="920"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.3%;top:78.3%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Recommended: on Profile, press <b class="gd-ui">Set up two-step sign-in</b> and follow the steps with an authenticator app.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-stuck-on-a-page" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Stuck on a page?</h2><p class="gd-p">If you work on a page for a few minutes without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks <b class="gd-ui">Need a hand with</b> the page. <b class="gd-ui">Open the guide section</b> opens this guide at the right chapter in a sheet from the bottom of the screen; <b class="gd-ui">Back to what I was doing</b> closes it and everything you typed is still there. <b class="gd-ui">Open the Academy lesson</b> opens the lesson in a new tab. <b class="gd-ui">Not now</b> quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while a renter signs.</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>When we update our terms of use, our privacy policy or an agreement you signed with us, the next time you open your portal it shows <b class="gd-ui">We&#39;ve updated our terms</b>: a short summary of what changed and the new text. Tick that you read it and press <b class="gd-ui">Accept</b> to continue. It does not change an agreement you already signed or a past booking.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-your-first-days" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your first days</h2><p class="gd-p">Your portal opens in order: the academy (Training) first, then your staff agreement, then your jobs. Welcome shows each step and asks for the name you go by. Once both are done, Welcome and Today show the team&#39;s WhatsApp group: join it, then press <b class="gd-ui">I joined</b>.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-the-weekly-townhall-release-35" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The weekly townhall (release 35)</h2><p class="gd-p">Every Wednesday at 1:00 pm Toronto time, and everyone attends. Open <b class="gd-ui">Townhall</b>: <b class="gd-ui">Join the call</b> there, or <b class="gd-ui">Check in</b> from 15 minutes before, counts you as there. You get a reminder an hour before.</p></section>');
